        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Comparing scars before dinner",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Jump off the roof into the mirror",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Felt like summer to my December",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Was it my August? Shit, I don't remember",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "(Two, three, go)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I know my temperature was set",
          "rhyme": "Et",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You finally flew south",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "The bird gon' leave the nest, you're so chromatic",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "At least I had it (Uh)",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Instead of never",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Or maybe I'm too dramatic",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
