        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "It's poison in that gumbo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Emotion, feel Dumbo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Ask me where my love go",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "That bitch walked outside the front door (My love is gone)",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Knock, knock, knock, knock (Who is it?)",
          "rhyme": "Ok",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "I'm not shocked, I brought this on me",
          "rhyme": "@",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "It's my fault, you gon' leave",
          "rhyme": "av",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Lesson taught, see",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "The weatherman told me it wasn't rainin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "My stupid ass brought umbrellas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "I got a glimpse of your cloud and felt better",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Now it's ninety degrees, and all the tricks up my sleeve",
          "rhyme": "iv",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Is drenched in sweat and delusion because I jet to conclusions",
          "rhyme": "$",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "You got your thing (Ch-ch-ch), I got nothing (Ch-ch-ch) but memories",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "I know your secrets, nigga (Yeah)",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "I'm not bitter or nothing, I understand that",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Everybody making a choice according to plan and",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "We had two different blueprints, but understood influence (Gone)",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "You opened up early on, I thought I had a permit",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "You started buildin' a bridge and turned it into a fence",
          "rhyme": "#s",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Then my buildin' got tore down all because of your new tenant",
          "rhyme": "#",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "I'll just buy up some new shit, never down with a lease (Gone)",
          "rhyme": "iz",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "You never lived in your truth, I'm just happy I lived in it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "But I finally found peace, so peace (Gone)",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "(Want me to do it over? Where? Everything)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "persona_igor"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AAAABCDEFGHIJKFHHLMFMLNOPQ",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AAAABBCDEFDGEHEDDIIEIIEEDJ"
    },
